author ai
group index
note How symbols and xrefs come from a language server. build walks the root and takes every file whose text hash matches the cache; the rest are parsed with tree-sitter and, if the language has a server, marked pending. index_file then asks the language's server per pending file for document symbols, outgoing calls per symbol and references per symbol, and each file's answer is applied as it completes. The CLI runs this to completion before answering; the GUI runs it on a thread and greys out what is still pending.

